5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about who is actually in charge when the system breaks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The depot floor does not stop for office projects. I need to know the calendar.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I have seen systems age quietly and external work come back broken.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We are short on people. I need to see how the change lands on staff.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The headline price is a lie. I need to see the real long-term cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, the calendar is critical. If we freeze, we lose revenue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, exactly. The yard equipment is old. It must survive the rollout.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, I agree. Hidden costs are where projects die.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the people who know the system are leaving. That is a risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, yes. If we lose the admins, we lose the knowledge.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the support ownership during the last outage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
