17,1,3,talk,May,,I will review the upgrade history of the dispatch tool.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the administrator retirements and hiring times.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will also check the warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
