35,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The last outage sat unowned for two days. Four suppliers, no one in charge.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The peak season has no freeze window. One cutover cost two days of paper dispatch.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. Testing it all at once takes weeks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year. The last posting stayed open for eleven months.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Bundled agreements held price. Separately licensed pieces climbed yearly.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, that cutover risk is real. We cannot freeze in winter.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, yes. The yard devices are a mix of old models. They are fragile.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, so modular systems will bleed us dry over time?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, the external data lift in 2018 caused errors for a year.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, the board trims capital but lets operating costs pass. That is the trap.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,The warehouse rules were rewritten twice mid-year. The scope never survived.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The 2021 scheduling trial was ringed with spreadsheets within a month.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,The 2018 pay move had mismatched route codes for a year. External work is risky.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Depot supervisors dropped the new steps within weeks. They keep their own routines.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The outright purchase only cost maintenance. The subscriptions keep rising.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,We need a single point of accountability. The current setup is a mess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,We need something that works with our old yard devices and tight calendar.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,We need to avoid external data migration if possible. It is too error-prone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,We need to train people who will actually use the new system.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,We need a fixed cost structure. No surprise add-ons.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
